{"product_id":"concerning-kate","title":"Concerning Kate","description":"\u003cp\u003eKate Conway thinks she has her whole life mapped out for her, a rosy future with her husband Charlie and their wonderful daughter Emily. But when Charlie's ex-girlfriend turns up on the scene, things go horribly wrong. Heartbroken by his lies, Kate is determined to put her life back together. Her attempts to fend off the well-meant interference of friends and family leave her with a lodger she's not sure she needs. Jack Marsden turns out to be handsome, charming and recovering from a heartbreak of his own, so things get more complicated. Emily is missing her Daddy - and Kate is too. So when Charlie returns, Kate finds herself with a difficult choice to make. Should she forgive and forget, or take a chance on finding happiness with another?\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:152 x 232  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Joan O'Neill \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780340818459 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 448\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43520570851481,"sku":"14RC9780340818459","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/a22b3040a2031b7c43460a25f780759d.jpg?v=1698142470","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/concerning-kate","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}